[2026-03-14T21:43:56.372Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VjnD87pTx5BsvKmWBbHpSg","type":"tool_result","content":"434:- **Expected**: A multi-select dropdown opens showing all statuses: Backlog (dotted circle, gray), Todo (circle, gray), In Progress (half circle, yellow), In Review (three-quarter circle, blue), Done (check circle, green), Cancelled (x-circle, red). Each option has a checkbox.\n449:- **Expected**: A multi-select dropdown opens showing: Urgent (alert-triangle, red), High (arrow-up, orange), Medium (minus, yellow), Low (arrow-down, blue), No Priority (dots-horizontal, gray). Each option has a checkbox.\n459:- **Expected**: A multi-select dropdown opens showing all workspace labels with their colored dots and names. Each option has a checkbox.\n593:## Team Issues Page (`/team/:teamId/issues`)\n599:#### Test: Team Issues page renders with header showing team name\n603:#### Test: Team Issues page shows issues grouped by status (default)\n607:#### Test: Team Issues page shows all team issues, not just current user's\n611:#### Test: Team Issues page shows empty state when team has no issues\n615:#### Test: Issue row displays all required fields including checkbox and team prefix\n617:- **Expected**: The issue row displays: a checkbox for bulk selection (unchecked), High priority icon (orange arrow-up), identifier \"ENG-42\" with team prefix, title \"Fix login bug\", In Progress status icon (yellow half circle), \"Bug\" label as a small colored badge, assignee avatar, due date \"Mar 20\", and project name \"Auth Rewrite\".\n668:- **Expected**: The issue row does not show empty placeholders for labels, due date, project, or assignee. Only the present fields (checkbox, priority, identifier, title, status) are shown.\n686:#### Test: Issue row checkboxes are visible and unchecked by default\n688:- **Expected**: Each issue row has a checkbox on the left side. All checkboxes are unchecked by default.\n690:#### Test: Clicking a checkbox selects an issue\n692:- **Action**: User clicks the checkbox on ENG-42\n693:- **Expected**: The checkbox becomes checked. The issue row has a selected visual style (e.g., highlighted background). A bulk action toolbar appears at the top or bottom of the list.\n695:#### Test: Clicking a checked checkbox deselects the issue\n696:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, ENG-42 checkbox is checked, bulk action toolbar is visible\n697:- **Action**: User clicks the checkbox on ENG-42 again\n698:- **Expected**: The checkbox becomes unchecked. The selected visual style is removed from the row. If no other issues are selected, the bulk action toolbar disappears.\n700:#### Test: Multiple issues can be selected via checkboxes\n702:- **Action**: User clicks checkboxes on ENG-42 and ENG-44\n703:- **Expected**: Both ENG-42 and ENG-44 are checked with selected visual style. ENG-43 remains unchecked. The bulk action toolbar shows \"2 selected\" or similar count indicator.\n706:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, no issues selected, no bulk action toolbar visible\n707:- **Action**: User clicks the checkbox on ENG-42\n708:- **Expected**: A bulk action toolbar appears showing the selection count (\"1 selected\") and action buttons for: Status change, Priority change, Assignee change, and Label change.\n711:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, ENG-42 is selected, bulk action toolbar is visible\n713:- **Expected**: The bulk action toolbar disappears. No action buttons are visible.\n716:- **Initial state**: User is authenticated, ENG-42 (status \"Todo\") and ENG-43 (status \"Backlog\") are selected via checkboxes\n717:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Status\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"In Progress\" from the dropdown\n718:- **Expected**: Both ENG-42 and ENG-43 are updated to \"In Progress\" status. They move to the \"In Progress\" group. The changes are persisted to the database. The checkboxes are deselected and the bulk toolbar disappears.\n722:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Priority\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"High\" from the dropdown\n727:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Assignee\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"Bob\" from the member selector\n732:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Label\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"Feature\" from the label picker\n737:- **Action**: User selects ENG-42 and ENG-43, bulk-changes status to \"In Progress\", then selects ENG-44 and ENG-45, bulk-changes priority to \"High\"\n738:- **Expected**: Both bulk actions complete successfully. The first pair is in \"In Progress\" status, the second pair has \"High\" priority. The bulk toolbar appears and disappears correctly each time.\n740:#### Test: Select all checkbox in group header selects all issues in that group\n742:- **Action**: User clicks a \"select all\" checkbox in the \"Backlog\" group header\n743:- **Expected**: All 3 issues in the Backlog group are selected (checkboxes checked, selected visual style). The bulk toolbar shows \"3 selected\". Issues in other groups remain unselected.\n745:#### Test: Deselect all via group header checkbox","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSKR4mrzp6Gp1zQhuyMY2R","session_id":"7b212afb-79da-42cc-8433-9cf67c998ecd","uuid":"0b2ed4ce-b10a-42ab-bedf-8eddd79e30e7"}
