 bulk toolbar, selects \"In Progress\" from the dropdown\n718:- **Expected**: Both ENG-42 and ENG-43 are updated to \"In Progress\" status. They move to the \"In Progress\" group. The changes are persisted to the database. The checkboxes are deselected and the bulk toolbar disappears.\n720:#### Test: Bulk priority change updates all selected issues\n722:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Priority\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"High\" from the dropdown\n725:#### Test: Bulk assignee change updates all selected issues\n727:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Assignee\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"Bob\" from the member selector\n730:#### Test: Bulk label change updates all selected issues\n732:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Label\" action in the bulk toolbar, selects \"Feature\" from the label picker\n735:#### Test: Bulk actions can be performed multiple times in sequence\n737:- **Action**: User selects ENG-42 and ENG-43, bulk-changes status to \"In Progress\", then selects ENG-44 and ENG-45, bulk-changes priority to \"High\"\n738:- **Expected**: Both bulk actions complete successfully. The first pair is in \"In Progress\" status, the second pair has \"High\" priority. The bulk toolbar appears and disappears correctly each time.\n743:- **Expected**: All 3 issues in the Backlog group are selected (checkboxes checked, selected visual style). The bulk toolbar shows \"3 selected\". Issues in other groups remain unselected.\n748:- **Expected**: All 3 issues are deselected. If no other issues are selected, the bulk toolbar disappears.\n1521:#### Test: Cycle detail issue list supports bulk actions\n1523:- **Action**: User selects checkboxes on 3 issues, then uses the bulk action to change status to \"In Progress\".\n1967:#### Test: Issue checkboxes enable bulk selection\n1970:- **Expected**: Both issues are visually selected (highlighted row or checked checkbox). A bulk actions toolbar appears at the top showing the count of selected issues (e.g., \"2 selected\").\n1972:#### Test: Bulk action — change status for multiple issues\n1973:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected via checkboxes. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n1974:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Status\" bulk action button and selects \"Done\".\n1977:#### Test: Bulk action — change priority for multiple issues\n1978:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n1979:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Priority\" bulk action button and selects \"Urgent\".\n1982:#### Test: Bulk action — change assignee for multiple issues\n1983:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n1984:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Assignee\" bulk action button and selects \"Bob Jones\".\n1987:#### Test: Bulk action — change label for multiple issues\n1988:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. Issues \"ENG-42\" and \"ENG-43\" are selected. Bulk actions toolbar is visible.\n1989:- **Action**: User clicks the \"Label\" bulk action button and selects \"Feature\".\n1992:#### Test: Deselect all clears bulk selection\n1993:- **Initial state**: User is viewing `/project/1`, Issues tab. 2 issues are selected and bulk toolbar is showing.\n1995:- **Expected**: All issue selections are cleared. The bulk actions toolbar disappears.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSKR4mrzp6Gp1zQhuyMY2R","session_id":"7b212afb-79da-42cc-8433-9cf67c998ecd","uuid":"74beb491-e9b1-4e2f-9f55-8d1ae2989418"}
