[2026-03-14T21:44:29.464Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CSKR4mrzp6Gp1zQhuyMY2R","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile my findings into a comprehensive report:\n\n## Summary: LinearClone App - Test Context for Bulk Actions and Checkboxes in Team Issues\n\nI've thoroughly explored the LinearClone application and gathered all necessary context for writing tests about bulk actions and checkboxes in team issues. Here's what I found:\n\n### 1. **App Directory**\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`\n- **Tech Stack**: React 18, Redux, TypeScript, Vite, Playwright for testing\n- **Database**: Neon (PostgreSQL) with serverless Netlify Functions\n\n### 2. **Test Specifications Document**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (2,685 lines)\n- Contains comprehensive test specifications for the entire application including:\n  - Team Issues Page tests (lines 593-934)\n  - Bulk Actions tests (lines 684-749)\n  - Checkbox selection tests\n  - Group select-all functionality\n\n### 3. **Existing Test Files** (14 test files total)\nLocated in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n- `team-issues.spec.ts` - Main team issues page tests\n- `team-issues-row.spec.ts` - Individual issue row tests  \n- `team-issues-create.spec.ts` - Create issue functionality\n- `my-issues.spec.ts`, `my-issues-row.spec.ts`, `my-issues-filters.spec.ts` - Related tests\n- Other pages: login, signup, sidebar, inbox, notification, keyboard shortcuts\n\n### 4. **Key Components for Bulk Actions & Checkboxes**\n\n#### **BulkActions Component**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx`\n- **Features**:\n  - Appears when issues are selected\n  - Shows count of selected items: \"X selected\"\n  - Four action buttons: Status, Priority, Assignee, Label\n  - Dropdowns for each action type\n  - Cancel button to deselect all\n  - Test IDs: `bulk-actions-toolbar`, `bulk-actions-count`, `bulk-action-status`, etc.\n  - CSS styling at: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.css`\n\n#### **TeamIssuesList Component**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx`\n- **Features**:\n  - Individual issue checkboxes (unchecked by default)\n  - Group header checkboxes for \"select all in group\"\n  - Integration with Redux state for selection management\n  - Test IDs: `issue-checkbox-{issueId}`, `team-issue-group-select-{groupKey}`\n  - CSS styling at: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.css`\n\n#### **Redux State Management**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts`\n- **State**:\n  - `selectedIds: string[]` - Array of selected issue IDs\n  - `groupBy` - Current grouping (status, priority, assignee, project, label, none)\n  - `sortBy` - Current sort order\n  - `items` - List of team issues\n  - `members` - Team members for assignee options\n- **Actions**:\n  - `toggleIssueSelection` - Toggle individual issue checkbox\n  - `selectGroupIssues` - Toggle \"select all in group\"\n  - `bulkUpdateIssues` - Async thunk for bulk updates\n  - `clearSelection` - Clear all selections\n\n#### **API Endpoint**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/bulk-update-issues.ts`\n- **Method**: PUT `/api/bulk-update-issues`\n- **Payload**: `{ issueIds: string[], status?: string, priority?: string, assigneeId?: string|null, labelId?: string }`\n- **Features**: Updates multiple issues with status, priority, assignee, or labels\n\n### 5. **Test Data / Seed Data**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n- **Engineering Team (ENG)** has 8 issues:\n  - ENG-1: In Progress, High priority, assigned to Alice (Bug label)\n  - ENG-2: Todo, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Feature label)\n  - ENG-3: Backlog, Low priority, unassigned (Feature label)\n  - ENG-4: In Review, High priority, assigned to Carol (Improvement label)\n  - ENG-5: Done, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Documentation label)\n  - ENG-6: Todo, Urgent priority, assigned to Alice (Bug label)\n  - ENG-7: Backlog, No Priority, unassigned (Improvement label)\n  - ENG-8: In Progress, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Feature label)\n- **Design Team (DES)** has 3 issues for testing\n- **Team Members**: Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith, Carol Davis\n- **Labels**: Bug (red), Feature (green), Improvement (blue), Documentation (purple)\n- **Statuses**: Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled\n\n### 6. **Playwright Configuration**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test\n- Reporter: Replay.io with JSON and HTML reports\n- Device: Replay Chromium with action timeout of 15 seconds\n\n### 7. **Test Specification Details for Bulk Actions & Checkboxes**\n\n**Lines 686-748 in tests.md cover:**\n- Checkboxes visible and unchecked by default\n- Single checkbox selection/deselection\n- Multiple checkbox selection\n- Bulk action toolbar appearance/disappearance\n- Bulk status changes across selected issues\n- Bulk priority changes across selected issues\n- Bulk assignee changes across selected issues\n- Bulk label changes across selected issues\n- Sequential bulk operations\n- Group header \"select all\" functionality\n- Group header \"deselect all\" functionality\n\n**Testing Patterns Used in Existing Tests:**\n- API-based login helper: `loginViaApi(baseURL, email, password)`\n- Navigation helper: `loginAndNavigateToTeamIssues(page, baseURL, email, password)`\n- Test data IDs for assertions: `data-testid` attributes throughout\n- Expect conditions: `toBeVisible()`, `toContainText()`, `toHaveCount()`, `toHaveText()`\n- Timeouts: 30 seconds for loading, 10 seconds for interactions\n\n### 8. **Package.json & Dependencies**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/package.json`\n- Key testing dependency: `@playwright/test@^1.52.0`\n- Replay.io support: `@replayio/playwright@^5.0.2`\n- Test script: `npm test` (runs via tsx scripts/test.ts)\n\n### 9. **Important CSS Classes for Selectors**\n- Bulk Actions: `.bulk-actions`, `.bulk-actions-toolbar`, `.bulk-actions-count`, `.bulk-actions-btn`\n- Group Checkboxes: `.team-issues-group-select`, `.team-issues-group-checkbox`\n- Issue Rows: `.issue-row`, `.team-issues-group-items`\n- Group Headers: `.team-issues-group-header`, `.team-issues-group-toggle`\n\nThis comprehensive context provides everything needed to write thorough tests for bulk actions and checkbox functionality in the team issues page."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a0c01d7dcbc6bc550 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 80656\ntool_uses: 37\nduration_ms: 46143</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7b212afb-79da-42cc-8433-9cf67c998ecd","uuid":"ca6a7d49-90c6-4e17-a763-8f302a28352d","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"I need to find information about the linear-clone app for writing tests about bulk actions and checkboxes in team issues. Find:\n1. The app directory under /repo/apps/ for the linear clone app\n2. The docs/tests.md file with test specifications\n3. Any existing test files (*.spec.ts) \n4. The team issues page component and any bulk action / checkbox related components\n5. The playwright config\n6. Any seed data files\n\nBe thorough - I need to understand the full context for writing these tests.","agentId":"a0c01d7dcbc6bc550","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile my findings into a comprehensive report:\n\n## Summary: LinearClone App - Test Context for Bulk Actions and Checkboxes in Team Issues\n\nI've thoroughly explored the LinearClone application and gathered all necessary context for writing tests about bulk actions and checkboxes in team issues. Here's what I found:\n\n### 1. **App Directory**\n- **Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`\n- **Tech Stack**: React 18, Redux, TypeScript, Vite, Playwright for testing\n- **Database**: Neon (PostgreSQL) with serverless Netlify Functions\n\n### 2. **Test Specifications Document**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (2,685 lines)\n- Contains comprehensive test specifications for the entire application including:\n  - Team Issues Page tests (lines 593-934)\n  - Bulk Actions tests (lines 684-749)\n  - Checkbox selection tests\n  - Group select-all functionality\n\n### 3. **Existing Test Files** (14 test files total)\nLocated in `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`:\n- `team-issues.spec.ts` - Main team issues page tests\n- `team-issues-row.spec.ts` - Individual issue row tests  \n- `team-issues-create.spec.ts` - Create issue functionality\n- `my-issues.spec.ts`, `my-issues-row.spec.ts`, `my-issues-filters.spec.ts` - Related tests\n- Other pages: login, signup, sidebar, inbox, notification, keyboard shortcuts\n\n### 4. **Key Components for Bulk Actions & Checkboxes**\n\n#### **BulkActions Component**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.tsx`\n- **Features**:\n  - Appears when issues are selected\n  - Shows count of selected items: \"X selected\"\n  - Four action buttons: Status, Priority, Assignee, Label\n  - Dropdowns for each action type\n  - Cancel button to deselect all\n  - Test IDs: `bulk-actions-toolbar`, `bulk-actions-count`, `bulk-action-status`, etc.\n  - CSS styling at: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/BulkActions.css`\n\n#### **TeamIssuesList Component**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.tsx`\n- **Features**:\n  - Individual issue checkboxes (unchecked by default)\n  - Group header checkboxes for \"select all in group\"\n  - Integration with Redux state for selection management\n  - Test IDs: `issue-checkbox-{issueId}`, `team-issue-group-select-{groupKey}`\n  - CSS styling at: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/TeamIssuesList.css`\n\n#### **Redux State Management**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/teamIssuesSlice.ts`\n- **State**:\n  - `selectedIds: string[]` - Array of selected issue IDs\n  - `groupBy` - Current grouping (status, priority, assignee, project, label, none)\n  - `sortBy` - Current sort order\n  - `items` - List of team issues\n  - `members` - Team members for assignee options\n- **Actions**:\n  - `toggleIssueSelection` - Toggle individual issue checkbox\n  - `selectGroupIssues` - Toggle \"select all in group\"\n  - `bulkUpdateIssues` - Async thunk for bulk updates\n  - `clearSelection` - Clear all selections\n\n#### **API Endpoint**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/bulk-update-issues.ts`\n- **Method**: PUT `/api/bulk-update-issues`\n- **Payload**: `{ issueIds: string[], status?: string, priority?: string, assigneeId?: string|null, labelId?: string }`\n- **Features**: Updates multiple issues with status, priority, assignee, or labels\n\n### 5. **Test Data / Seed Data**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts`\n- **Engineering Team (ENG)** has 8 issues:\n  - ENG-1: In Progress, High priority, assigned to Alice (Bug label)\n  - ENG-2: Todo, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Feature label)\n  - ENG-3: Backlog, Low priority, unassigned (Feature label)\n  - ENG-4: In Review, High priority, assigned to Carol (Improvement label)\n  - ENG-5: Done, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Documentation label)\n  - ENG-6: Todo, Urgent priority, assigned to Alice (Bug label)\n  - ENG-7: Backlog, No Priority, unassigned (Improvement label)\n  - ENG-8: In Progress, Medium priority, assigned to Bob (Feature label)\n- **Design Team (DES)** has 3 issues for testing\n- **Team Members**: Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith, Carol Davis\n- **Labels**: Bug (red), Feature (green), Improvement (blue), Documentation (purple)\n- **Statuses**: Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled\n\n### 6. **Playwright Configuration**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test\n- Reporter: Replay.io with JSON and HTML reports\n- Device: Replay Chromium with action timeout of 15 seconds\n\n### 7. **Test Specification Details for Bulk Actions & Checkboxes**\n\n**Lines 686-748 in tests.md cover:**\n- Checkboxes visible and unchecked by default\n- Single checkbox selection/deselection\n- Multiple checkbox selection\n- Bulk action toolbar appearance/disappearance\n- Bulk status changes across selected issues\n- Bulk priority changes across selected issues\n- Bulk assignee changes across selected issues\n- Bulk label changes across selected issues\n- Sequential bulk operations\n- Group header \"select all\" functionality\n- Group header \"deselect all\" functionality\n\n**Testing Patterns Used in Existing Tests:**\n- API-based login helper: `loginViaApi(baseURL, email, password)`\n- Navigation helper: `loginAndNavigateToTeamIssues(page, baseURL, email, password)`\n- Test data IDs for assertions: `data-testid` attributes throughout\n- Expect conditions: `toBeVisible()`, `toContainText()`, `toHaveCount()`, `toHaveText()`\n- Timeouts: 30 seconds for loading, 10 seconds for interactions\n\n### 8. **Package.json & Dependencies**\n- **File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/package.json`\n- Key testing dependency: `@playwright/test@^1.52.0`\n- Replay.io support: `@replayio/playwright@^5.0.2`\n- Test script: `npm test` (runs via tsx scripts/test.ts)\n\n### 9. **Important CSS Classes for Selectors**\n- Bulk Actions: `.bulk-actions`, `.bulk-actions-toolbar`, `.bulk-actions-count`, `.bulk-actions-btn`\n- Group Checkboxes: `.team-issues-group-select`, `.team-issues-group-checkbox`\n- Issue Rows: `.issue-row`, `.team-issues-group-items`\n- Group Headers: `.team-issues-group-header`, `.team-issues-group-toggle`\n\nThis comprehensive context provides everything needed to write thorough tests for bulk actions and checkbox functionality in the team issues page."}],"totalDurationMs":46143,"totalTokens":80656,"totalToolUseCount":37,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"ca